earth-and-climate/landscapes-geomorphology/lecture-notes-slides/pre_ms_landscape_26.pdf
scripts/_work/

# Book library (added 2026-10-29: ~8 GB of PDFs/DjVu/EPUB organised from Downloads as <subject>/<topic>/books/).
# The vault is auto-committed AND pushed to GitHub by Kurooto, so new books are NOT tracked.  Books tracked before this date stay
# tracked (gitignore never affects tracked files).  To track a book anyway: `git add -f <file>`; to track all new books, delete these lines.
physics/*/books/
math/*/books/
chemistry/*/books/
biology/*/books/
earth-and-climate/*/books/
